{
  "data": {
    "lines": [
      "import { msm } from \"msm:runtime\";",
      "",
      "// Called once a second by the \"msm:on_tick\" event of msm_examples:antidote.",
      "msm.actions.define(\"msm_examples:antidote_cure\", (e) => {",
      "  const holder = e.other;",
      "  if (holder === undefined || !holder.isAlive) return;",
      "  const level = holder.effectLevel(\"msm_examples:antidote\");",
      "  if (holder.hasEffect(\"minecraft:poison\")) {",
      "    holder.removeEffect(\"minecraft:poison\");",
      "    e.world.playSound(\"minecraft:entity.witch.drink\", holder.pos);",
      "  }",
      "  if (holder.health < holder.maxHealth) holder.heal(level);",
      "  e.world.spawnParticle(\"minecraft:happy_villager\", holder.pos.offset(0, 1, 0), {",
      "    count: 2 * level,",
      "    spread: 0.4,",
      "  });",
      "});"
    ]
  },
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "id": "msm_examples:antidote_handler",
  "kind": "msm:script",
  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "The script that defines the handler msm_examples:antidote_cure. e.other is the effect's holder; hasEffect and removeEffect cure its poison, and effectLevel (the amplifier plus 1) scales the healing and the particles. Scripts run only in the Fabric mod jar export, with msm_runtime; the Java project export leaves them out.",
    "tags": [
      "example",
      "scripts"
    ]
  }
}
